<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean Daewoo Elec up on Thomson deal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean Daewoo Elec up on Thomson deal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in South Korea's Daewoo Electronics Co rose 420 won to their upper limit of 7,420 in early Thursday morning trading, brokers said.</p>
<p>Analysts said the shares were boosted by news that Daewoo would take over French consumer electronics maker Thomson Multimedia.</p>
